    <unit id="SemanticIconDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>The status icon of the message card. Customize its size, brush and line height.</source>
        <target state="translated">訊息卡片的狀態圖示元素，可自訂尺寸、筆刷與行高。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticListContentDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>The notice arrangement container of the message list. Customize its direction, order and alignment.</source>
        <target state="translated">訊息列表的 notice 排列容器，可自訂方向、順序與對齊。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticListRootDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>The message list root. It hosts the cards, queue, timeout and host layer lifecycle.</source>
        <target state="translated">訊息列表根元素，承載卡片、佇列、逾時與宿主層生命週期。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticPartStyleDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Mirrors the upstream style-class demo: object styles and type-branched function styles shape the card root, icon and title through owner-scoped Semantic Part styles.</source>
        <target state="translated">對齊上游 style-class 範例：物件式樣式與按類型分支的函式式樣式，透過 owner 作用域的 Semantic Part 樣式自訂卡片 root、icon 與 title。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticPartStyleTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Custom Semantic Part styling</source>
        <target state="translated">自訂語義結構的樣式</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticRootDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>The message card root. It hosts the content, type, close state and enter/leave motion.</source>
        <target state="translated">訊息卡片根元素，承載內容、類型、關閉狀態與進出場動效。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticTitleDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>The message text element. Customize its color, font size, line height and wrapping.</source>
        <target state="translated">訊息文字元素，可自訂文字顏色、字級、行高與換行。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticWrapperDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>The wrapping element for the icon and title. Customize the layout, alignment and gap.</source>
        <target state="translated">圖示與標題的包裹元素，可自訂版面、間距與對齊。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="StackDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Stack configuration, disabled by default. Messages will be stacked when the amount is over threshold. Only the latest message is shown in the collapsed stack.</source>
        <target state="translated">堆疊設定預設關閉。當訊息數量超過閾值時將摺疊顯示；摺疊狀態下只顯示最新一條訊息。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
